WEBVTT

00:00.890 --> 00:05.860
<b>KUDOU RESIDENCE
NARA PREFECTURE</b>

00:05.860 --> 00:07.860
<b>KUDOU</b>

00:10.150 --> 00:13.820
<b>Thank you for allowing us
to have your time tonight.</b>

00:14.780 --> 00:16.870
<b>It's been a long time.</b>

00:16.870 --> 00:21.750
<b>The last time we met face to face
was last summer, I think.</b>

00:22.120 --> 00:27.500
<b>Thank you again for your support
regarding the Golden Electron Silkworms.</b>

00:28.250 --> 00:34.130
<b>In truth, I'm not in any position
to appear before you in person...</b>

00:34.470 --> 00:37.550
<b>but you asked to see me yourself today.</b>

00:37.550 --> 00:39.180
<b>That makes me happy.</b>

00:39.180 --> 00:40.640
<b>I'm honored.</b>

00:41.180 --> 00:45.520
<b>Kyoko has informed me
of the nature of your business.</b>

00:45.520 --> 00:48.230
<b>To capture Gongjin Zhou.</b>

00:48.230 --> 00:53.650
<b>This would be a mission ordered by Maya,
no... by Ms. Yotsuba, I presume.</b>

00:53.940 --> 00:55.280
<b>That's correct.</b>

00:55.570 --> 00:56.820
<b>Ah...</b>

00:57.280 --> 01:02.620
<b>The Ten Master Clans are shackled
by the rules designated by the Clans Conference.</b>

01:02.910 --> 01:10.040
<b>One of them prohibits any collusion or collaboration
without first going through the Conference...</b>

01:10.040 --> 01:12.760
<b>except in the case of emergencies.</b>

01:13.380 --> 01:14.260
<b>Right.</b>

01:14.670 --> 01:20.050
<b>We cannot accept a request for cooperation
from the Yotsubas as the Kudou Family.</b>

01:20.680 --> 01:25.430
<b>So, I intend to accept this request from you,
Tatsuya Shiba the individual...</b>

01:25.430 --> 01:29.480
<b>as Retsu Kudou, another individual.</b>

01:30.190 --> 01:32.110
<b>- Thank you very much.
- Thank you very much.</b>

01:33.530 --> 01:35.490
<b>Good work, all three of you!</b>

01:35.820 --> 01:40.120
<b>We have a simple meal prepared,
so please join us if you'd like.</b>

01:41.450 --> 01:43.540
<b>He should be here any minute now.</b>

01:43.950 --> 01:44.950
<b>What?</b>

01:46.160 --> 01:47.620
<b>Come in!</b>

01:48.960 --> 01:50.380
<b>Pardon me.</b>

01:51.670 --> 01:55.380
<b>Grandfather told me to join you all.</b>

03:33.190 --> 03:36.230
<b>Nice to meet you.
I'm the youngest son of Makoto Kudou...</b>

03:36.230 --> 03:39.240
<b>the current head of the Kudou Family,
a first year student at Second High School.</b>

03:39.610 --> 03:41.360
<b>Minoru Kudou.</b>

03:41.360 --> 03:43.990
<b>I'm honored to meet you all.</b>

03:45.450 --> 03:47.870
<b>Nice to meet you. I'm Tatsuya Shiba.</b>

03:47.870 --> 03:49.500
<b>I'm his younger sister, Miyuki.</b>

03:50.040 --> 03:53.620
<b>I had the privilege of seeing your performances
during the Nine Schools Competition.</b>

03:53.960 --> 03:57.250
<b>Oh, and please call me "Minoru."</b>

03:57.250 --> 03:59.340
<b>Since I'm younger than you.</b>

03:59.340 --> 04:02.130
<b>I'd also appreciate it
if you didn't use honorifics with me.</b>

04:02.590 --> 04:05.010
<b>Then, we'll call you "Minoru," all right?</b>

04:05.430 --> 04:07.760
<b>And please call me "Miyuki"!</b>

04:08.100 --> 04:10.310
<b>You can just call me "Tatsuya."</b>

04:11.310 --> 04:11.930
<b>Oh!</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:14.140
<b>Pardon me!</b>

04:14.140 --> 04:17.570
<b>I still haven't greeted you!
My name is Minami Sakurai!</b>

04:17.900 --> 04:21.280
<b>I'm very pleased to make
your acquaintance, Master Minoru!</b>

04:21.820 --> 04:24.950
<b>Oh, well, that was so polite of you.</b>

04:24.950 --> 04:28.240
<b>But... if you don't mind, I'd rather
not be called "Master Minoru."</b>

04:28.700 --> 04:31.120
<b>Minoru, please forgive her.</b>

04:31.120 --> 04:34.000
<b>It's Minami's custom,
or should I say it's her nature?</b>

04:34.000 --> 04:35.880
<b>Do you think you could indulge her?</b>

04:36.420 --> 04:39.460
<b>Well, if that's the case...</b>

04:39.460 --> 04:42.010
<b>it's nice to meet you, Ms. Sakurai.</b>

04:44.680 --> 04:48.010
<b>Please, if you could call me "Minami"...</b>

04:48.550 --> 04:51.520
<b>Uh, r-right. Very well, then.</b>

05:01.360 --> 05:05.950
<b>Minoru, it's not a matchmaking session,
so there's no need to be so nervous.</b>

05:05.950 --> 05:09.410
<b>What? Oh, sorry, Big Sister Kyoko.</b>

05:09.700 --> 05:13.750
<b>You, too, Minami. I'm sure
it's difficult to open up all a sudden,</b>

05:13.750 --> 05:16.540
<b>but you should relax a bit.</b>

05:16.540 --> 05:19.710
<b>Sorry, Big Sister Miyuki.</b>

05:20.210 --> 05:22.420
<b>Now, now, don't say that, Miyuki.</b>

05:22.420 --> 05:26.220
<b>It would be too much of a feat
for a 16-year-old girl to not get nervous...</b>

05:26.220 --> 05:29.350
<b>in front of a boy her age
whom she's just met.</b>

05:30.010 --> 05:35.310
<b>Brother, I'm also 16,
and I'm meeting Minoru for the first time.</b>

05:35.310 --> 05:39.560
<b>Are you telling me that I don't fall
under the "girl" category?</b>

05:39.980 --> 05:43.440
<b>But you're not just any girl.
You're a refined young lady.</b>

05:44.990 --> 05:48.320
<b>Well... listen to you, Brother!</b>

05:50.950 --> 05:54.040
<b>You two siblings are very close, aren't you?</b>

05:54.660 --> 05:56.960
<b>They're so close, I don't know what to do.</b>

05:57.410 --> 06:00.460
<b>I don't remember ever putting you
on the spot, Ms. Fujibayashi.</b>

06:02.750 --> 06:05.050
<b>I'm a little envious.</b>

06:05.380 --> 06:10.850
<b>Since my brothers are a lot older than me,
I don't really talk to them that much.</b>

06:10.850 --> 06:13.220
<b>And I don't have any friends, either.</b>

06:13.760 --> 06:17.430
<b>Really? You must have friends at school, right?</b>

06:17.810 --> 06:20.310
<b>I've been frail since I was born.</b>

06:20.310 --> 06:22.730
<b>So, I tend to miss school a lot.</b>

06:24.230 --> 06:27.320
<b>But I'm feeling well this week!</b>

06:27.320 --> 06:31.200
<b>Oh, wait! You're all spending
the night here, aren't you?</b>

06:31.780 --> 06:34.080
<b>No, we have lodgings nearby.</b>

06:34.580 --> 06:37.830
<b>So, you're not going to spend the night here?</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:42.290
<b>Don't be unreasonable now.</b>

06:42.290 --> 06:45.420
<b>It's better to wait until you're closer
to do that kind of thing.</b>

06:45.420 --> 06:46.840
<b>Right.</b>

06:47.130 --> 06:52.140
<b>Anyway, why don't you take them
on a tour tomorrow, Minoru?</b>

06:52.140 --> 06:54.600
<b>Yes. Since I tend to stay home from school,</b>

06:54.600 --> 06:59.100
<b>I know I'm more knowledgeable
about Grandfather's work than my brothers.</b>

06:59.640 --> 07:03.610
<b>Is your task to search
for the Traditionalist Magicians, Mr. Tatsuya?</b>

07:03.610 --> 07:04.980
<b>More or less.</b>

07:04.980 --> 07:07.610
<b>Then, I think I might be useful to you.</b>

07:08.190 --> 07:12.030
<b>Since the Traditionalists' bases
are concentrated the most in Kyoto.</b>

07:12.030 --> 07:15.700
<b>There's also quite a number
of primary bases in Nara.</b>

07:16.080 --> 07:17.870
<b>I'll show you around tomorrow.</b>

07:18.410 --> 07:22.370
<b>We'll take you up on that offer.
I'm counting on you, then, Minoru.</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:24.380
<b>Right!</b>

07:28.260 --> 07:30.130
<b>OCTOBER 7, A.D. 2096</b>

07:35.800 --> 07:37.850
<b>Good morning, everyone!</b>

07:37.850 --> 07:40.020
<b>I've come to pick you up.</b>

07:43.850 --> 07:45.770
<b>Minoru, is that...</b>

07:46.400 --> 07:47.320
<b>Oh...</b>

07:47.320 --> 07:48.690
<b>This?</b>

07:49.240 --> 07:52.990
<b>I need to be able to store
more than 99 activation sequences.</b>

07:52.990 --> 07:55.830
<b>That's why I'm wearing one on each wrist.</b>

07:56.200 --> 08:01.830
<b>But thanks to this Thought-Controlled CAD,
it's much easier now.</b>

08:02.160 --> 08:06.210
<b>That's impressive that you're able
to use that many spells.</b>

08:07.340 --> 08:09.960
<b>You're praising me too much.</b>

08:38.200 --> 08:40.910
<b>There's a base right in the city?</b>

08:41.290 --> 08:46.880
<b>No, the Traditionalists' major base
is in Mikasayama.</b>

09:16.360 --> 09:17.950
<b>Brother?</b>

09:17.950 --> 09:20.780
<b>There were so many tourists,
and now they're gone.</b>

09:21.620 --> 09:24.620
<b>A Mental Interference-Type Spell.
It's a barrier.</b>

09:25.250 --> 09:26.620
<b>Do you mean enemies?</b>

09:27.170 --> 09:30.380
<b>It seems like there's a high-ranking
barrier magic user among them.</b>

09:30.380 --> 09:32.840
<b>They kept their magic output
to a minimum...</b>

09:33.420 --> 09:37.380
<b>and made sure we wouldn't catch onto them
until the last minute.</b>

09:37.380 --> 09:44.230
<b>Of course, they probably didn't count on you
noticing their spell so soon, Mr. Tatsuya.</b>

09:45.980 --> 09:46.810
<b>Minami!</b>

09:46.810 --> 09:47.480
<b>Right!</b>

09:53.530 --> 09:54.320
<b>- What?
- What?</b>

10:05.960 --> 10:09.330
<b>Amazing! It's like the Holy Grail!</b>

10:09.960 --> 10:12.340
<b>Please let me handle the rest.</b>

10:17.550 --> 10:18.090
<b>Oh!</b>

10:21.100 --> 10:24.100
<b>Is that an illusion? Unbelievable!</b>

10:24.430 --> 10:25.520
<b>Parade.</b>

10:25.930 --> 10:29.440
<b>It's the Kudou Family's secret art,
incorporating elements of ninjutsu.</b>

10:30.690 --> 10:33.150
<b><i>That precision is incredible!</i></b>

10:33.150 --> 10:35.070
<b><i>I think he's even better than Lina!</i></b>

11:01.220 --> 11:01.970
<b>Take this!</b>

11:07.180 --> 11:09.480
<b>Did anyone get hurt?</b>

11:09.890 --> 11:12.100
<b>Uh, no.</b>

11:12.560 --> 11:15.610
<b>The fact that they were waiting
to ambush us here...</b>

11:15.610 --> 11:20.360
<b>means that they probably knew
we were heading to their secret base.</b>

11:20.700 --> 11:22.450
<b>It looks like it.</b>

11:22.450 --> 11:25.240
<b>Most likely, they've already cleared
out of that base.</b>

11:25.780 --> 11:29.960
<b>Brother, don't you think
it would be wise to get moving now?</b>

11:29.960 --> 11:32.630
<b>If we stay here too long, people will...</b>

11:34.000 --> 11:35.500
<b>You're right.</b>

11:35.500 --> 11:38.010
<b>Let's call it a day, then.</b>

11:40.340 --> 11:41.970
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART II</b>

11:44.640 --> 11:45.970
<b>I'll see you guys off here, then.</b>

11:46.510 --> 11:48.470
<b>I enjoyed myself today.</b>

11:48.470 --> 11:50.980
<b>No, you, too, really helped us out.</b>

11:51.520 --> 11:53.730
<b>Will I see you again?</b>

11:54.310 --> 11:58.730
<b>Well, our work isn't done yet.
We should be traveling back here again soon.</b>

11:59.070 --> 12:01.740
<b>When that happens,
I think we'll be needing your help.</b>

12:02.240 --> 12:05.070
<b>Please, I'll be happy to do
whatever you need!</b>

12:05.410 --> 12:09.250
<b>If I can be of use to you in any way,
I'll be glad to help!</b>

12:09.660 --> 12:11.870
<b>Thanks, Minoru.</b>

12:12.410 --> 12:14.040
<b>All right, then, see you.</b>

12:14.040 --> 12:16.380
<b>Yes! See you then!</b>

12:17.880 --> 12:20.760
<b>OCTOBER 8, A.D. 2096</b>

12:19.760 --> 12:20.760
<b>Nakura...</b>

12:21.090 --> 12:24.260
<b>Do you remember
that boy named Tatsuya Shiba?</b>

12:24.840 --> 12:29.270
<b>He was Ms. Mayumi's underclassman
in high school and a good friend, I believe.</b>

12:29.770 --> 12:31.140
<b>That's right.</b>

12:31.140 --> 12:35.060
<b>That boy visited the Kudous
the day before yesterday.</b>

12:35.060 --> 12:37.730
<b>It seems like he had a meeting
with Master Kudou.</b>

12:39.190 --> 12:42.700
<b>I don't care if Gongjin Zhou
gets taken out by the Yotsubas.</b>

12:42.700 --> 12:46.450
<b>But if he's ever held captive
by the Yotsubas,</b>

12:46.450 --> 12:49.870
<b>it's highly likely
that it'll inconvenience my own family.</b>

12:50.200 --> 12:54.000
<b>We can't let the Yotsubas know
of that man's connection to the Saegusas.</b>

12:56.880 --> 13:00.210
<b>You're aware of Gongjin Zhou's location?</b>

13:00.210 --> 13:03.260
<b>We have a method of contacting him.</b>

13:03.880 --> 13:06.590
<b>Then, summon Gongjin Zhou.</b>

13:06.590 --> 13:09.260
<b>And dispose of him for sure.</b>

13:09.810 --> 13:11.310
<b>Understood.</b>

13:11.640 --> 13:15.640
<b>Oh... And remember to have someone
take over bodyguard duty for Mayumi as usual.</b>

13:16.650 --> 13:18.900
<b>I know what I have to do.</b>

13:24.490 --> 13:28.490
<b>Um, Yoshida, you can go now, really.</b>

13:28.490 --> 13:30.530
<b>No, then there'd be no point.</b>

13:31.160 --> 13:33.870
<b>If anything were to happen to you
between here and your house,</b>

13:33.870 --> 13:36.920
<b>I wouldn't be able to look
your parents in the eye!</b>

13:37.460 --> 13:41.630
<b>But... Yoshida, you're so busy now that
you're the chairman of the Disciplinary Committee,</b>

13:41.630 --> 13:46.630
<b>so I can't help feeling bad that you have to
escort me to school and back every day.</b>

13:47.180 --> 13:51.760
<b>It's fine. Going home from school
with you is fun for me, too.</b>

13:52.260 --> 13:53.140
<b>What?</b>

13:53.720 --> 13:54.640
<b>O-Oh...</b>

14:01.440 --> 14:02.940
<b>Please, be my guest.</b>

14:03.280 --> 14:04.900
<b>Okay, I'll get in first.</b>

14:12.790 --> 14:14.290
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

14:14.910 --> 14:17.330
<b>No. It's nothing.</b>

14:17.960 --> 14:20.580
<b>OCTOBER 10, A.D. 2096</b>

14:24.590 --> 14:26.340
<b>What happened? Is it urgent?</b>

14:26.760 --> 14:29.970
<b>On our way home yesterday,
someone was targeting Ms. Shibata.</b>

14:30.390 --> 14:31.640
<b>Mizuki?</b>

14:31.640 --> 14:33.350
<b>Ms. Shibata has no idea.</b>

14:33.720 --> 14:36.480
<b>It was just shikigamis
and someone watching her from afar,</b>

14:36.480 --> 14:39.230
<b>but I nullified all of their spells.</b>

14:39.850 --> 14:43.360
<b>I see. It really was a good thing
that you were with her.</b>

14:43.730 --> 14:46.650
<b>Why would they go after Ms. Shibata?</b>

14:46.650 --> 14:49.240
<b>They weren't just your average thugs!</b>

14:49.740 --> 14:51.990
<b>You mean they were professional criminals?</b>

14:51.990 --> 14:54.290
<b>Those were underground magicians!</b>

14:54.290 --> 14:56.830
<b>So, why would they
be targeting Ms. Shibata?</b>

14:57.160 --> 14:59.120
<b>If the Thesis Competition is their objective...</b>

14:59.120 --> 15:02.210
<b>then Mr. Isori and Ms. Nakajo
should be the ones they're after!</b>

15:02.960 --> 15:06.210
<b>Tatsuya! You're not hiding something
from us, are you?</b>

15:06.670 --> 15:11.090
<b>That shikigami activation sequence you showed me
the other day... You didn't just stumble upon it!</b>

15:11.430 --> 15:13.720
<b>It had something to do
with that incident, too, didn't it?</b>

15:16.390 --> 15:21.480
<b>Tatsuya, you're always denying things
by saying, "There's no need for that"...</b>

15:21.480 --> 15:24.110
<b>but I feel indebted to you.</b>

15:24.110 --> 15:28.860
<b>It's all thanks to you that I was able to regain
my confidence and powers as a magician.</b>

15:29.360 --> 15:30.360
<b>But...</b>

15:31.030 --> 15:35.740
<b>if I don't know what's going on,
there's no way I can protect Ms. Shibata!</b>

15:37.290 --> 15:38.910
<b>I can't go into detail as to why.</b>

15:38.910 --> 15:40.120
<b>Tatsuya!</b>

15:42.000 --> 15:47.210
<b>The foreign magicians who guided the enemy agents
during the Yokohama Disturbance last year...</b>

15:47.210 --> 15:49.510
<b>are being sheltered by the Traditionalists.</b>

15:49.800 --> 15:52.380
<b>That's who I'm pursuing.</b>

15:56.260 --> 15:57.390
<b>Sorry.</b>

15:57.720 --> 15:59.640
<b>That's all I can tell you.</b>

16:00.390 --> 16:02.520
<b>I'm the one who should be apologizing.</b>

16:02.520 --> 16:05.150
<b>And thanks for telling me.</b>

16:07.400 --> 16:08.530
<b>Tatsuya...</b>

16:08.530 --> 16:10.280
<b>You said they were Traditionalists, right?</b>

16:11.110 --> 16:14.030
<b>The Traditionalists' headquarters is in Kyoto...</b>

16:14.030 --> 16:16.330
<b>where this year's
Thesis Competition is being held.</b>

16:16.330 --> 16:17.620
<b>That's what I've heard.</b>

16:17.950 --> 16:22.750
<b>I was going to send you guys to Kyoto
so that you could also check on the security...</b>

16:22.750 --> 16:24.250
<b>but I think I'll join you.</b>

16:24.790 --> 16:25.750
<b>And?</b>

16:26.090 --> 16:29.510
<b>That way, you'll be free
to move around in the city.</b>

16:29.920 --> 16:33.430
<b>On paper, I'll write that you're patrolling
the venue and its surroundings over a wide area.</b>

16:34.470 --> 16:36.510
<b>I'd really appreciate that.</b>

16:36.510 --> 16:38.680
<b>So, Mikihiko, what about you?</b>

16:39.310 --> 16:40.930
<b>I'm going to be your decoy.</b>

16:40.930 --> 16:49.070
<b>I'll unleash a flashy search talisman
that'll really rub the Traditionalists the wrong way!</b>

16:49.650 --> 16:51.070
<b>I see.</b>

16:51.490 --> 16:56.030
<b>But... there's also a chance that you'll get attacked
while setting off your talisman.</b>

16:56.410 --> 16:58.830
<b>Why don't you reach out
to Leo and Erika, too?</b>

16:58.830 --> 16:59.700
<b>Good idea.</b>

17:00.410 --> 17:04.710
<b>Well, I'm sure those two will butt in
even if I don't ask them to.</b>

17:05.250 --> 17:06.830
<b>No doubt.</b>

17:07.170 --> 17:08.710
<b>What about Mizuki?</b>

17:09.920 --> 17:13.090
<b>It would be too dangerous
to take Ms. Shibata.</b>

17:13.420 --> 17:16.760
<b>In that case, let me find
a bodyguard for Mizuki.</b>

17:16.760 --> 17:18.100
<b>Can you do that?</b>

17:18.680 --> 17:20.100
<b>Of course.</b>

17:20.100 --> 17:23.350
<b>After all, I'm the one who off-loaded the job
onto you in the first place.</b>

17:23.980 --> 17:27.350
<b>OCTOBER 11, A.D. 2096</b>

17:33.530 --> 17:34.360
<b>Mr. Nakura...</b>

17:35.740 --> 17:37.360
<b>Did I keep you waiting?</b>

17:38.410 --> 17:40.990
<b>No, you're right on time...</b>

17:40.990 --> 17:42.370
<b>Mr. Zhou.</b>

17:43.120 --> 17:45.370
<b>It's been a long time.</b>

17:45.370 --> 17:48.130
<b>What did you want to see me about today?</b>

17:48.960 --> 17:52.510
<b>Are you aware that Kudou
has joined forces with the Yotsubas?</b>

17:53.300 --> 17:55.880
<b>Could that be for my sake?</b>

18:01.010 --> 18:04.980
<b>To think that not only the Yotsubas,
currently the most powerful in the world,</b>

18:04.980 --> 18:10.610
<b>but also Kudou, who was once known
as "the Pinnacle," would be targeting me...</b>

18:11.020 --> 18:14.030
<b>I must say, I've really come up in the world.</b>

18:14.570 --> 18:17.740
<b>Having been hostile to them
for years, Kudou must know...</b>

18:17.740 --> 18:21.080
<b>all there is to know
about the Traditionalists by now.</b>

18:21.080 --> 18:27.040
<b>It probably won't be long
before he tracks down your hideout.</b>

18:28.370 --> 18:30.840
<b>I see. That's true.</b>

18:30.840 --> 18:36.550
<b>So, are the Saegusas going to offer me
a new hideout?</b>

18:37.380 --> 18:38.260
<b>Yes.</b>

18:38.630 --> 18:43.060
<b>I will take you to a place
where the Yotsubas can never get to you.</b>

18:43.810 --> 18:45.180
<b>Oh?</b>

18:45.180 --> 18:47.640
<b>And the name of that place...</b>

18:47.640 --> 18:50.060
<b>It wouldn't be "the afterlife," would it?</b>

18:50.900 --> 18:53.360
<b>No! The name of that place is "Hell"!</b>

19:05.200 --> 19:07.500
<b>Is that Water Needle?</b>

19:07.500 --> 19:10.790
<b>Asking to meet you by the river
was a mistake, I see.</b>

19:17.590 --> 19:22.890
<b>And your spell uses shadows as a medium
to create synthetic beasts, right?</b>

19:23.350 --> 19:25.220
<b>You can tell?</b>

19:25.220 --> 19:29.520
<b>I'm going to get rid of those unruly dogs,
owner and all.</b>

19:34.110 --> 19:39.030
<b>I just had this suit tailored for me,
so I can't have you riddling it with holes.</b>

20:27.870 --> 20:35.330
<b>It appears that I wasn't being deceived
by an illusion, was I?</b>

20:35.330 --> 20:41.050
<b>That's right. I was the one
who was taking you on in battle.</b>

20:42.470 --> 20:45.050
<b>Deceiving... vectors...</b>

20:45.050 --> 20:46.760
<b>Is this...</b>

20:46.760 --> 20:50.560
<b>Qimen Dunjia?</b>

20:51.430 --> 20:56.940
<b>Still, I have to say, I haven't shed
this much blood in a while.</b>

20:56.940 --> 21:02.190
<b>Personally, I'd say that your powers
are superior to Mitsugu Kuroba's.</b>

21:04.910 --> 21:07.700
<b>I'm honored to hear that.</b>

21:09.290 --> 21:13.210
<b>You and I shared the same sake together.</b>

21:13.210 --> 21:16.830
<b>Do you have any last requests?</b>

21:17.290 --> 21:20.210
<b>If you say so, there's just one.</b>

21:21.050 --> 21:22.720
<b>What would that be?</b>

21:23.760 --> 21:25.720
<b>I want you to...</b>

21:26.220 --> 21:28.100
<b>die along with me!</b>

21:38.020 --> 21:40.110
<b>Since it's your last request...</b>

21:40.400 --> 21:43.530
<b>I'd love to grant it to you, but...</b>

21:55.620 --> 22:00.750
<b>...unfortunately, it's not possible
to kill me using magic of that level.</b>

23:36.310 --> 23:39.940
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
ANCIENT CITY INSURRECTION PART III</b>
